  "subsystemType": "Hrot.Scenario",
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "terrainName": "demo-city",
  "description": "What: a small test range for an external PLAYER STATION (docs/DESIGN_Player_Join.md D-9): two Blue riflemen marked Playable ('Rifleman 1', 'Rifleman 2') beside an enterable house with glazed windows; a Blue AI squad; a Red squad 150 m south that engages at once; an empty HMMWV (free driver seat), a motorcycle (driver + firing pillion), a riding horse (rider firing seat); a flamethrower burning a timber shed and a car; an 8 kg charge breaching a timber hut's wall at 12 s (a walkable doorway); civilians, a dog, cattle, birds, SUMO traffic. Rules for Blue: 'Hold the house' (2 min, progress), Blue tickets (20, -1 per man down), a per-man score, a welcome message at 2 s. A free Playable unit runs as AI until taken. Generated by scripts/gen-showcase-player-station.py. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh player-station"
 },
